# Bundled fonts (OFL)

Metric-compatible substitutes for Microsoft Office core fonts. These files are
**not** Microsoft fonts and are distributed under open licenses:

| File | Substitutes | License |
|------|-------------|---------|
| Carlito-Regular.ttf, Carlito-Bold.ttf | Calibri | SIL Open Font License 1.1 (Google Crosextra Carlito) |
| LiberationSans-Regular.ttf, LiberationSans-Bold.ttf | Arial / Helvetica | SIL Open Font License 1.1 (Liberation Fonts) |
| LiberationSerif-Regular.ttf, LiberationSerif-Bold.ttf | Times New Roman | SIL Open Font License 1.1 (Liberation Fonts) |
| NotoSans-Regular.ttf | UI fallback | SIL Open Font License 1.1 (Google Noto) |

Sources:

- Carlito: https://github.com/googlefonts/crosextra-carlito
- Liberation: https://github.com/liberationfonts/liberation-fonts
- Noto Sans: https://fonts.google.com/noto/specimen/Noto+Sans
